# Copy to .env and fill in from the Supabase dashboard (Project Settings -> API).
# Both are EXPO_PUBLIC_*, so they are inlined into the bundle at build time and are
# public by design. The publishable key grants nothing on its own — RLS is what
# protects the data. Never put the service_role key here.
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PROJECT_ID=
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
